430">do </span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.640">the </span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:30.600">rest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.810" end="00:34.260"><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:31.590">Welcome </span><span begin="00:31.590" end="00:31.740">to </span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:31.920">th</span><span begin="00:31.920" end="00:31.950">е </span><span begin="00:31.950" end="00:32.670">internet</span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.760">! </span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:33.090">What </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.270">would </span><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.510">you </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.720">pref</span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:34.140">е</span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:34.230">r</span><span begin="00:34.230" end="00:34.260">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.260" end="00:38.250"><span begin="00:34.260" end="00:34.500">Would </span><span begin="00:34.500" end="00:34.680">you </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:34.980">like </span><span begin="00:34.980" end="00:35.100">to </span><span begin="00:35.100" end="00:35.460">fight </span><span begin="00:35.460" end="00:35.610">for </span><span begin="00:35.610" end="00:36.120">civil </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.480">rights </span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:36.570">or </span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:36.960">tweet </span><span begin="00:36.960" end="00:37.080">a </span><span begin="00:37.080" end="00:37.500">racial </span><span begin="00:37.500" end="00:38.070">slur</span><span begin="00:38.070" end="00:38.250">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.250" end="00:42.570"><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.520">Be </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:39.120">happy</span><span begin="00:39.120" end="00:39.240">! </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.480">Be </span><span begin="00:39.480" end="00:40.080">horny</span><span begin="00:40.080" end="00:40.200">! </span><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:4